    <title>Vol.12｜如何成为上海精致男人？ What Makes a Man in Shanghai？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a8b27bdef65145dfcc42248</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a8b27bdef65145dfcc42248</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 06:31:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>⚠️警告：本集含有敏感内容，未成年人禁止收听</span></p><p><span>上海男人有无数种样子，可以精致也可以粗糙，只要不影响到别人，你可以活成任何你想要的样子，这个可能也是大城市的魅力之一。</span></p><p><span>本期有点标题党了，本期播客仅讨论Niall哥个人的成长变美之路，如有雷同，纯属巧合。</span><br><span>-</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a> : 从发型聊起，就这三两根毛，到底折腾过多少事情！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="779">12:59</a> : 是啊，Niall是医美狂魔啊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1229">20:29</a> : 30+依旧可以戴牙套啊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1509">25:09</a> : 190减肥减到130？到底做对了什么？有啥轻松减肥小妙招吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2380">39:40</a> : 精致男人一定要毛发管理啊！i mean everywhere～</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2860">47:40</a>：哈？私密处怎么还做过小手术啊！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3345">55:45</a> : 脚过臭还是建议去看下医生啦！</span></p><p><span>-</span></p><p><span>BGM：Jordan Dennis; Blasko - Crumbs；</span></p><p><span>-</span></p><p><span>主播：</span></p><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cba9574000000001001baef" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cba9574000000001001baef"><span>@真实小孟哥</span></a></p><p><span>抖音：</span><a href="https://v.douyin.com/RBmX6V1jrBc/" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/RBmX6V1jrBc/"><span>@augusttt15</span></a></p><p><span>嘉宾：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b0cc435e8ac2b4ef6e99371?xsec_token=YB52xG0ku7n1BBHpjAYEHHeGQ2M6Kh6Vf-gLxyaE57QyM=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5cba9574000000001001baef&amp;apptime=1787503734&amp;share_id=9508549729014c1796184036a78b67a2&amp;wechatWid=2de64b5c077ee57ddcd96a355227d64f&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b0cc435e8ac2b4ef6e99371?xsec_token=YB52xG0ku7n1BBHpjAYEHHeGQ2M6Kh6Vf-gLxyaE57QyM=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5cba9574000000001001baef&amp;apptime=1787503734&amp;share_id=9508549729014c1796184036a78b67a2&amp;wechatWid=2de64b5c077ee57ddcd96a355227d64f&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>@Niall想有腹肌</span></a><span> 互联网小厂内容运营 励志要美丽到生命最后一天的ESTJ双鱼男</span></p><p><span>-</span><br><span>【蚊子叮叮】着眼于当下年轻人的生活观察，从旅行、职场、生活方式等多领域的杂谈型播客 ，没有营养，纯粹聊天！</span></p>]]></description>
