    <title>Vol.11｜在尼罗河里裸泳？这是违法的吧！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a81cd1036641f136d891c66</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a81cd1036641f136d891c66</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 14:59:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>谁不想急头白脸地去埃及美美玩一趟，本期「蚊子叮叮」邀请到了在旅行中爱冒险爱探险的Even，分享一下他在埃及旅行的故事。（需要提示的是，内容中部分旅行中的危险行为，请勿模仿）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">01:41</a>：为啥对埃及情感这么重啊？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="186">03:06</a>：在尼罗河里面裸泳</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="811">13:31</a>：盐湖也一定要下去啊，有伤口的人除外</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1006">16:46</a>：所以在埃及有吃到什么美食吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a>：金字塔必去啊！还被当地人带去了special for 中国人的秘密景点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1654">27:34</a>：神庙，给到古迹爱好者超大杯</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1968">32:48</a>：其实也有不好的体验</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2329">38:49</a>：埃及之行，1到10分打几分 </span></p><p><span>-</span></p><p><span>BGM：Banda Ionica - Lorenzo in Sicilia ; 孙盛希 - INFP；</span></p><p><span>-</span></p><p><span>主播：</span></p><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cba9574000000001001baef" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cba9574000000001001baef"><span>@真实小孟哥</span></a></p><p><span>抖音：</span><a href="https://www.douyin.com/user/MS4wLjABAAAAtHO9J_VXkOVGL8h86dMKDIagZnh1TbD1aA8Keo9jV54" data-url="https://www.douyin.com/user/MS4wLjABAAAAtHO9J_VXkOVGL8h86dMKDIagZnh1TbD1aA8Keo9jV54"><span>@augusttt15</span></a></p><p><span>嘉宾：Evan 半生老鼠留，一世阑珊苟。发疯一般地留学过，发疯一般地工作过，现在正在发疯一般地活着。</span></p><p><span>-</span></p><p><span>【蚊子叮叮】着眼于当下年轻人的生活观察，从旅行、职场、生活方式等多领域的杂谈型播客 ，没有营养，纯粹聊天！</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
