    <title>Vol.10｜品咖金舌头，快把江浙沪美咖交出来！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69fe11bce1eb34a93901e470</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69fe11bce1eb34a93901e470</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 09 May 2026 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>「蚊子叮叮」的主播</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cba9574000000001001baef" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cba9574000000001001baef"><strong><span>@真实小孟哥</span></strong></a><span>是品咖界金舌头，谁还不知？今天邀约到了大湾区品咖银舌头</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/599019f082ec3967d2a034e5?xsec_token=ABQjFyQIcwNswLCA4Dyol8XYmD5Blf-I-VksJSHJf9-ro%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/599019f082ec3967d2a034e5?xsec_token=ABQjFyQIcwNswLCA4Dyol8XYmD5Blf-I-VksJSHJf9-ro%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search"><span>@</span><strong><span>咖啡狗whacky</span></strong></a><span>，一起畅聊下他这次来江浙沪在上海、杭州、苏州品尝过的美咖。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">03:12</a> 江浙沪选出来最值得喝的咖啡店是……</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 上海好喝的咖啡店有哪些，金银舌头分门别类来推荐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1827">30:27</a> 什么？银舌头竟然觉得杭州咖啡胜过上海咖啡？WHY？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2268">37:48</a> 苏州咖啡怎么样？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2676">44:36</a> 去日本旅游那么多次，有没有什么咖啡厅让金舌头印象深刻？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2427">40:27</a> 未来的音乐计划</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2972">49:32</a> 金银舌头分别如何与咖啡结缘并走上自媒体之路的？</span></p><p><span>-</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/599019f082ec3967d2a034e5?xsec_token=ABQjFyQIcwNswLCA4Dyol8XYmD5Blf-I-VksJSHJf9-ro%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/599019f082ec3967d2a034e5?xsec_token=ABQjFyQIcwNswLCA4Dyol8XYmD5Blf-I-VksJSHJf9-ro%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search"><span>@咖啡狗whacky</span></a><span>推荐的美咖：</span></p><p><span>上海：</span></p><p><span>Core Coffee</span></p><p><span>有容乃大</span></p><p><span>blacksheep</span></p><p><span>Haw Side Coffee</span></p><p><span>O.P.S.</span></p><p><span>Goat is Dancing cafe</span></p><p><span>coffee aroma</span></p><p><span>杭州</span></p><p><span>皮箱工坊咖啡</span></p><p><span>缓奏</span></p><p><span>别饮居</span></p><p><span>咖啡与理想</span></p><p><span>避难所咖啡</span></p><p><span>-</span></p><p><span>BGM：Jordan Dennis Blasko - Crumbs；</span></p><p><span>-</span></p><p><span>主播：</span></p><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cba9574000000001001baef" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cba9574000000001001baef"><span>@真实小孟哥</span></a></p><p><span>抖音：</span><a href="https://v.douyin.com/OP5_6mqCltQ/" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/OP5_6mqCltQ/"><span>@augusttt15</span></a></p><p><span>嘉宾：</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/599019f082ec3967d2a034e5?xsec_token=ABQjFyQIcwNswLCA4Dyol8XYmD5Blf-I-VksJSHJf9-ro%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/599019f082ec3967d2a034e5?xsec_token=ABQjFyQIcwNswLCA4Dyol8XYmD5Blf-I-VksJSHJf9-ro%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search"><span>@咖啡狗whacky</span></a><span>：小红书咖啡博主，垂直做咖啡赛道是想赚钱，但是本人是一点都不垂的adhd和快乐小狗！</span></p><p><span>-</span></p><p><span>【蚊子叮叮】着眼于当下年轻人的生活观察，从旅行、职场、生活方式等多领域的杂谈型播客 ，没有营养，纯粹聊天！</span></p>]]></description>
