    <guid isPermaLink="false">68bc54a05faf3686595ab5ff</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Sep 2025 15:43:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>头发，是每个人一生一定会遇到的命题——找到适合自己的发型师、面对新造型的心理建设、压力脱发等等，本期「蚊子叮叮」邀请了“彩头女”阿嘉，与大家一起分享这些年在脑袋上做过的“花头精”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 阿嘉新造型的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">03:34</a> 小孟哥与两位发型届the one相识相知的故事，你爱一个男人，就很容易被男人受伤害。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="571">09:31</a> 小孟哥曾经竟然还做过卷发造型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="626">10:26</a> 小孟哥的染发之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">14:38</a> 阿嘉的染发之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 避雷染发产品及种草染发产品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a> 染发会给我的人生带来些什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1515">25:15</a> 关于晓华理发师爆火的联想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> 彩头去拍身份证或者护照之类的，怎么办呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1967">32:47</a> 生活及网络上观察到的靓丽发型大评论&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2101">35:01</a> 有生之年，你还想体验一个什么样的发型？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2195">36:35</a> 什么发型的男生会比较吸引人？ &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Jordan Dennis; Blasko - Crumbs；Sofi Tukker - &nbsp;They；李宇春 - 下个, 路口, 见；五月天 - 倔强；Avril Lavigne - Hello Kitty</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cba9574000000001001baef" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cba9574000000001001baef"><span>@真实小孟哥</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>抖音：</span><a href="https://v.douyin.com/OP5_6mqCltQ/ " data-url="https://v.douyin.com/OP5_6mqCltQ/ "><span>@augusttt15</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿嘉：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/54812d9fd6e4a96175302986?xsec_token=ABPqkmwLZ5oYhXGbSW5dMXBAFPZWTivzChaUPM65IUo-c%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/54812d9fd6e4a96175302986?xsec_token=ABPqkmwLZ5oYhXGbSW5dMXBAFPZWTivzChaUPM65IUo-c%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search"><span>@霹雳嘉嘉 </span></a><span>ENFP✌️小红书优秀退役女兵，裸辞勇闯东南亚旅居，此刻头发橘色🍊，立志染遍彩头走遍地球！ &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>【蚊子叮叮】着眼于当下年轻人的生活观察，从旅行、职场、生活方式等多领域的杂谈型播客 ，没有营养，纯粹聊天！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
